00:10:33.188 --> 00:10:38.187
I used to want to get
through it with a wind blur.

00:10:38.187 --> 00:10:41.645
And I would try to dispel
it as quickly as possible.

00:10:41.645 --> 00:10:46.313
So I would just always be thinking about
like all the things that I could do to get

00:10:46.313 --> 00:10:50.631
rid of this uncertainty because it
