00:10:50.631 --> 00:10:55.411
not knowing what was going to be next than
not having a goal that I can work towards.

00:10:55.411 --> 00:10:58.399
But now, if you can imagine this,

00:10:58.399 --> 00:11:04.960
instead of going at it with a wind blower,
