00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:09.985
different angles that I can approach it.

00:11:09.985 --> 00:11:11.854
Or if there's any openings or

00:11:11.854 --> 00:11:15.980
hints that can help me try to get
rid of this uncertain deep cloud.

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:22.402
And I think that helps me because it
makes me okay to be in that discomfort.

00:11:22.402 --> 00:11:25.044
It reduces my anxiety level.

00:11:25.044 --> 00:11:30.840
It also lets me excited about the future
