00:11:44.484 --> 00:11:49.760
I'm going to primarily focus in the
medical spa space in optometry for now.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:55.267
And so what I want you guys to take away
from this are some of the tips that I've

00:11:55.267 --> 00:11:57.009
learned through my journey.

00:11:57.009 --> 00:12:01.306
Number one,
it's okay not to have a crystallized and

00:12:01.306 --> 00:12:03.895
fully fleshed out plan or goal.

00:12:03.895 --> 00:12:05.737
It's really okay.

00:12:05.737 --> 00:12:09.227
You have to imagine that there's going to
be a lot of times that you pivot,

00:12:09.227 --> 00:12:11.370
your interests might change.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:15.159
Your strengths might get developed
more on the certain part and

00:12:15.159 --> 00:12:16.953
you want to use that strength.

00:12:16.953 --> 00:12:21.123
You might realize that you have some
weaknesses and before you because of that

00:12:21.123 --> 00:12:25.490
weakness, you wouldn't have that
ability to reach this certain goal.

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:30.301
But now that you can grow that weakness,
it's now become a strength and so

00:12:30.301 --> 00:12:32.951
now you can pivot and change your goals.

00:12:32.951 --> 00:12:34.223
So that's one.

00:12:34.223 --> 00:12:39.140
The next one is,
it's okay to change your goals and pivot.

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:42.689
And the reason why I say
this as a separate tip,

00:12:42.689 --> 00:12:45.744
is because sometimes people
feel really uncomfortable or

00:12:45.744 --> 00:12:49.066
they feel like they're feeling
when they change their goals.

00:12:49.066 --> 00:12:52.428
Because they told people that,
hey, this is what I want to do.

00:12:52.428 --> 00:12:56.738
And when they feel that they isn't
something that they want to continue

00:12:56.738 --> 00:13:01.560
doing, then they feel embarrassed or
a sense of shame that they didn't follow

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:05.018
through or deliver what they
thought they wanted to do.

00:13:05.018 --> 00:13:09.546
And this is a case, I would recommend
hiding it, keep it with yourself.

00:13:09.546 --> 00:13:12.290
Don't share it until
you've accomplished it.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:15.705
That worked really well for me.

00:13:15.705 --> 00:13:20.763
And the third is, just know that this
really is not it a destination for

00:13:20.763 --> 00:13:26.018
rather a journey that you're going
through and you should be enjoying.

00:13:26.018 --> 00:13:31.214
And the way that you can do it is instead
of thinking I have to create a three,

00:13:31.214 --> 00:13:36.380
five or a ten year plan, think of it
more in terms of a shorter sprint.

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:39.849
So maybe it's a six month plan,
or it's a year plan.

00:13:39.849 --> 00:13:45.176
But just give yourself the ability
to create almost like an MVP.

00:13:45.176 --> 00:13:50.531
And this is a business school so
using words that resonate.

00:13:50.531 --> 00:13:53.963
An MVP of your bowl and
just be able to have it but

00:13:53.963 --> 00:13:59.090
know that you can come back to edit it or
change it at any time.

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:01.511
So what are my goals at this point?

00:14:01.511 --> 00:14:03.562
It's twofold.

00:14:03.562 --> 00:14:08.414
One is to be 100% okay with uncertainty.

00:14:08.414 --> 00:14:12.680
And two is to remind myself every day.

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:18.217
That life is really about the journey and
not the destination.

00:14:18.217 --> 00:14:19.380
Thank you.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:24.501
